{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43612","headline":"药名联句 · 皮日休","name":"药名联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲待防风饼，须添薏苡杯。\n香然柏子後，尊泛菊花来。\n石耳泉能洗，垣衣雨爲裁。\n从容犀局静，断续玉琴哀。\n白芷寒犹采，青箱醉尚开。\n马衔衰草卧，乌啄蠹根回。\n雨过兰芳好，霜多桂末摧。\n朱儿应作粉，云母讵成灰。\n艺可屠龙胆，家曾近燕胎。\n墙高牵薜茘，障輭撼玫瑰。\n鸓鼠啼书户，蜗牛上研台。\n谁能将藁本，封与玉泉才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}